{"name": "I'm No Demonlord", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't miss the latest updates on [Discord / YouTube / X]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow and add us\u2014we\u2019re waiting for you! Check out the community information on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/e59a7b437fc38d49a2f691ea726acd57.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"615\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once upon a time, a legendary archmage sacrificed himself to cast a magical seal on a supervillain, allowing the kingdom to prosper. But when the king began arresting commoners without reason, the vanished people were never seen again. One day, the seal weakened, the demon king escaped, and possessed the player's adventurer character. Can he accept his new identity? Uncover the king's plot? Save \"kinds\" or destroy \"outsiders\"? Good or evil? It's your choice...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/c430f62358d70d6e9c82d1cdc398bb68.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"615\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Round up your friends for an adventure! The game currently supports both remote play and local co-op for two players. So, grab your buddy and join the adventure together! The mysterious plot awaits your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/378fc2f5c1d14b5514cfd3cb7859349b.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/378fc2f5c1d14b5514cfd3cb7859349b.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/378fc2f5c1d14b5514cfd3cb7859349b.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/97616a21460d4d4f35eee39dcdc45c57.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/97616a21460d4d4f35eee39dcdc45c57.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/97616a21460d4d4f35eee39dcdc45c57.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/9bb5d8a5621c9be624efbc43ae37a15f.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/9bb5d8a5621c9be624efbc43ae37a15f.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/9bb5d8a5621c9be624efbc43ae37a15f.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/84559b56891e6a36d338a0e6c528ff2b.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/84559b56891e6a36d338a0e6c528ff2b.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/84559b56891e6a36d338a0e6c528ff2b.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/422290f2e5c7c111b9b05f00369174ae.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"615\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 1000 construction mechanics, endless combinations. Say no to pure numerical growth experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players freely combine factions, with mechanisms interacting to create wondrous chemical reactions, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/b5463493473b9de7f8bfd067e67709e2.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/b5463493473b9de7f8bfd067e67709e2.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/b5463493473b9de7f8bfd067e67709e2.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/1470d4394e13b1d9e7251fe260bf5dfd.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/1470d4394e13b1d9e7251fe260bf5dfd.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/1470d4394e13b1d9e7251fe260bf5dfd.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/955615c48511580187b202423446d339.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"615\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can freely choose route branches based on their own needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure rooms, challenge rooms, and rare abilities await your discovery, making your build even more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/de875a909079304bf552d5d3e55fc951.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/de875a909079304bf552d5d3e55fc951.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/de875a909079304bf552d5d3e55fc951.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/7cb113b5fc24e9ceaa24fa2dbd2348a3.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/7cb113b5fc24e9ceaa24fa2dbd2348a3.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/7cb113b5fc24e9ceaa24fa2dbd2348a3.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "\"I'm No Demonlord\" is a Roguelike shooter bullet hell game. High freedom in mechanics leads to unique playthroughs. As a demon-possessed hero, battle enemies, grow, and unveil dark schemes. Can he accept his new role? Save \"kinds\" or destroy \"outsiders\"? Good or evil? The choice is yours.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/c5d4bb7a179f7f0d0265fb7b8b6d312f839e5bb4/header.jpg?t=1787219823", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Bullet Hell", "RPG", "Action Roguelike"], "developers": "NiaoWu Studio", "publishers": "NiaoWu Studio", "release_date": "Aug 5, 2026", "price": "$8.99", "appid": "3258560", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "21 March 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/c9UJivpkVr0", "first_seen": 1742515200.0, "review_rank": 1763}